{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"28f23b1c29684f7fc0c9a8fbac0f084a278c7745ea5c81d8b9d662fe9a127da6","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review gate / plan-relation snapshot reducer","key_entities":["rebar review-plan","plan-relation-snapshot-error","plan_relation_snapshot_error",".tickets-tracker","event_append._prepare_event","os.makedirs","_holds_no_events","test_resign_tolerates_a_concurrent_writer_churning_tracker_temp_files"],"problem_keywords":["plan-relation reducer","event-less directory","plan review indeterminate","store detritus","reducer error","empty ticket directory","relation snapshot"],"propositions":["A ticket directory with no CREATE or SNAPSHOT event causes the plan-relation reducer to fail, surfacing as INDETERMINATE verdict on unrelated tickets whose relation graph is traversed.","The reducer must tolerate event-less directories by skipping them with a warning naming the path, rather than failing the entire snapshot.","Empty directories created by incomplete writes persist locally, are invisible to git (which cannot track empty directories), and cannot be fixed by pulling or gitignore rules.","The writer continues to create ticket directories before their first event (via os.makedirs before atomic rename), and the reader-side tolerance fix repairs existing broken clones without risking concurrent-write races."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787353988213367001,"uuid":"54ca0ace-2824-4f59-bfd9-8c2167579d68"}